    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n103707" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τεχν-ητός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>artificial</i>, opp. natural, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐγῆς εἶδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Off.</u>
					3
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. σύμβολα</span>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεῖα</span>, <i><span class="en">
